# Shell scripts and SQL run on Linux, and this repo is edited on Windows.
# Without this, a checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites them with CRLF and
# the host fails at the shebang -- `bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M` --
# which reads like a missing binary rather than a line-ending problem.
# Both current scripts happen to be LF today; this stops that being luck.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.sql  text eol=lf
